      "value": "信号（Signal Browser Definition）：(ceq + che - dltt - dlc - dc - dvpa+ tstkp ) / (mve\\_c + che - dltt - dlc - dc - dvpa+ tstkp). Exclude if price less than 5. 组合规则（该页字段）：StockWeight=EW；LSQuantile=0.1；PortfolioPeriod=12.0个月；StartMonth=6.0；Sign=1.0；TestInOP=double sort size adj。股票池/过滤：abs(prc)>5。 Notes：Enterprise = operating = NOA in OP. So this should be NOA/P^NOA. Need to adjust sample dates: even though paper says it begins in 1962, there is only 1 stock for the first 5 months of 1962. Table 4a has double sort with most t-stats above 3. hand t-stat is 3.0 for simplicity and hand ret is 0.12. OP drops extreme obs but we don't.。 基线为原论文分组的多空组合（FAQ：baseline follows the original paper split；数据页写 monthly long-short following OPs）。未在该行写出的细节不补。"
